{"id":"nekuda","lemma":"некуда","pos":"adj","rank":1332,"glosses":["there is nowhere"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4d/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мне теперь некуда идти.","en":"I have nowhere to go now.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"now, at present"},null,{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Тебе больше некуда пойти.","en":"You've got nowhere left to go.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"any more"},null,{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Тому некуда было пойти.","en":"Tom had nowhere to go.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Некуда бежать.","en":"There's nowhere to run.","words":[null,{"g":"to run, to be running"}]},{"text":"Нам некуда сесть.","en":"We've got nowhere to sit.","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"to sit down"}]}]}